import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Overview — Sanmarg : Aparajita" description="Overview — Aparajita, an initiative by Sanmarg.">
<section>
           <div class="container sec-pad">
               <div class="row">
                   <div class="col-sm-12">
                       <span class="inside-header">
                           <h1>Overview</h1>
                       </span>
                   </div>
               </div>
           </div>
       </section>
<section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row sec-pad">
                <div class="col-sm-8 mx-auto">
                    <h3 class="hindi-font fw-bold quote-font">“मुश्किल है पर इतना भी नहीं, <span>कि तू कर ना सके</span>,<br> दूर है मंजिल लेकिन इतनी भी नहीं, <span>कि तु पा ना सके</span>,<br> तुम चलो तो सही, <span>तुम चलो तो सही…”</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-8">
                    <p><b>Aparajita &#8211; “Saluting Womanhood”</b> &#8211; is an institution celebrating and supporting women who showcase excellence and strength of purpose. She envisions a future where <b>every woman embraces the indomitable spirit that fuels her passion.</b><br><br>
                        Now more than a decade old, Aparajita was realised from conversations on a dilemma. Stories of women of all ages achieving incredible feats abound in the East of India &#8211; but they were barely talked about, much less appreciated. Aparajita is committed to <b>support these stories with a stage, a community of achievers and tangible support</b>. She believes in realising these women’s dreams and letting their stories give women and girls essential inspiration close to home. With time, Aparajita has scaled her influence and impact, touching the lives of stalwarts alongside unsung heroes alike. She has been endorsed by personalities such as <b>Shri Amitabh Bachchan and Brahma Kumari Sister Shivani</b>.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4 mob-img">
                    <img src="/images/insight.webp" alt="insights" class="img-fluid">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
<section class="sec-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-6 mx-auto text-center">
                      <img src="/images/1.webp" width="100%" height="350" alt="Section Image" style="object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section> 
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4 mt-4">
                    <p>Under the patronage of Sanmarg &#8211; Eastern India&#8217;s premier Hindi daily, as well as the grace of her incredible sponsors and partners, Aparajita has championed and honoured the paths of many women toward excellence.</p>
                    <p> <a href="/ourpartners" class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Our Partners</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-8 mt-4">
                    <p>With each edition, Aparajita has metamorphosed into more than just a prestigious accolade. From culture to sport to education, she has bettered the lives of many deserving women. In recent editions, she has felicitated Bhagwani Devi Dagar, sponsoring the then 94-year-old for the World Masters Athletic Indoor Championship in 2023 in Poland. ‘Sprinter Dadi’ went on to win 3 gold medals for India, a Guinness World Record and has received international critical acclaim.</p>
                    <p>Aparajita has given wings to women from the sports fraternity exuding hope and soul, including Olympian Suthirtha Mukherjee, para-athlete Rakshita Raju and archer Suman Purthy. She has extended herself to pressing causes in powerful ways. From supporting the children of sex workers with New Light Foundation as her beneficiary to Laxmi Murmu Educational Institute Aparajita has very humbly contributed to the Girija Devi Charitable Trust.</p>
                    <p><a href="/footprints" class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read More</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row founder-area sec-pad">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <h2 class="sub-hdr motif motif-1 mt-3">Founder&#8217;s Note</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4 ruchika" id="founder">
                    <img src="/images/Ruchika-BW-min.webp" alt="Ruchika Gupta Aparajita Sanmarg" class="img-fluid">
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-8">
                    <div class="sec-header">
                        <h2 class="text-uppercase">Ruchika Gupta</h2>
                        <h3><i>Founder Guardian</i></h3>
                    </div>
                    <div id="founderintro">
                        <p>In her early years, Aparajita was inspired by stories of women who broke through expectations and circumstances to effect meaningful change in their fields. She worked to bestow awards on them and honour them, humbly, with the pride she felt at their life’s work. With each edition, her pool of teachers, supporters and advisors has grown, stretching the boundaries of her mission and influence.</p>
                        <p><img src="/images/ruchika-sign.webp" alt="Ruchika Sign" class="img-fluid sign"></p>
                        <p><button class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" id="founderReadMoreBtn">Read More</button></p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="fullFounderNote" style="display:none">
                        <p>In her early years, Aparajita was inspired by stories of women who broke through expectations and circumstances to effect meaningful change in their fields. She worked to bestow awards on them and honour them, humbly, with the pride she felt at their life’s work. With each edition, her pool of teachers, supporters and advisors has grown, stretching the boundaries of her mission and influence.</p>
                        <p>Yet, as Aparajita’s impact has begun to make measurable waves, she has left us all stunned. We had never dreamed that her mission would become so much more urgent and relevant in the present. We did not expect that her community of nominees would become so diverse, or how benevolent and giving her patrons would come to be &#8211; not just towards Aparajita but for the women whom she can empower the most.</p>
                        <p>Aparajita has tuned her ear to stories that are difficult to find and known to few, that can only be heard if one is not just hearing but really listening. And she is listening.</p>
                        <p>The deeper she listens to these stories, the more needed she feels. These stories are of women who do what they do to strengthen other women’s lives, sometimes for profit, but always for good.</p>
                        <p>The future calls to Aparajita to honour these stories meaningfully. This is why she is now providing access to capital, a boost of confidence, a community and education to women who need it. This is where Aparajita was always meant to be.</p>
                        <p><img src="/images/ruchika-sign.webp" alt="Ruchika Gupta Sign" class="img-fluid sign"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row founder-area sec-pad mt-5">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <h2 class="sub-hdr mt-3">Nurturer&#8217;s Note</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4 vishnupriya" id="nurturer">
                    <img src="/images/VISSHNUPRIYA-BW-min.webp" alt="Vishnupriya Aparajita Sanmarg" class="img-fluid">
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-8">
                    <div class="sec-header">
                        <h2 class="text-uppercase">Visshnupriya</h2>
                        <h3><i>Chief Nurturer</i></h3>
                    </div>
                    <div id="nurturerintro">
                        <p>As I sit down to reflect on what Aparajita truly means to me, words seem inadequate to capture my strong attachment to her. My relationship with Aparajita is that of a friend I deeply care about, who has put me on a profound journey of self-realisation, growth, and strength.</p>
                        <p><button class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" id="nurturerReadMore">Read More</button></p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="nurturerFullContent" style="display:none">
                        <p class="mt-4">As I sit down to reflect on what Aparajita truly means to me, words seem inadequate to capture my strong attachment to her. My relationship with Aparajita is that of a friend I deeply care about, who has put me on a profound journey of self-realisation, growth, and strength.</p>
                        <p>Aparajita’s mission to change how women think and talk about their own achievements needs Herculean efforts and causes a whirlwind of emotions. Yet, we continue to stand by her in anticipation of an indescribable joy. This is the joy of engaging with the remarkable women we get the privilege to discover, meet and host. The joy of being unable to sleep because our minds keep replaying the incredible things we just saw, heard and felt. Aparajita has given me and her community this joy over and over again.</p>
                        <p>Each woman we encounter is an achiever in her own right, and the real challenge is in removing all biases and selecting just a few to share their stories. Aparajita becomes the voice that amplifies their voices, the body of work that celebrates their journeys, and reflects the confidence that inspires future generations to reach for the stars.</p>
                        <p>Aparajita has always been a lesson in being selfless. May her purpose continue to be fulfilled and her impact continue to expand.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Base>
